  "about_item": [
    "Extended Value 4-Collar Bundle: Maximize your dog's safety with our 4-pack set. This bundle provides a long-lasting barrier, ensuring consistent and effective defense without the need for messy monthly applications or expensive single-unit alternatives.",
    "Complete Fleas Ticks Control: Our advanced flea treatment for dogs is specifically engineered to repel and eliminate ticks, fleas, larvae, and lice upon contact. The formula acts quickly to stop pests and maintain a clean environment for your dog.",
    "Universal Adjustable Design: One size fits all breeds perfectly. This dog flea collar features an easy-to-use buckle system, making it an ideal flea collar for large dogs, medium breeds, and small dogs alike; simply trim the excess length for a custom, secure fit.",
    "Fully Waterproof Performance: Designed for active dogs, this flea and tick prevention for dogs remains 100% effective after swimming, bathing, or playing in the rain. There is no need to remove the collar, providing non-stop protection in any environment.",
    "Non-Greasy & Comfortable Fit: Unlike traditional topical drops, our flea treatment for dogs offers a clean and dry experience. It is designed to be gentle on your dog's skin while remaining professional-grade and tough on unwanted insects."
